; Run with: logo-midi native/examples/music-command-tour.lgo --output tour.mid
; WAIT uses FMSLogo's 1/60-second ticks and becomes timed silence in the MIDI.
TEMPO 120
CHANNEL 1
VELOCITY 96
GATE 0.8
PROGRAM 0
CC 1 32

NOTE 60 0.5
STEAL 0.1
ANTICIPATE 0.1
NOTE 64 0.5
WAIT 30
CHORD [60 64 67] 1
REST 0.5

TEMPO 60
WAIT 60
NOTE 72 0.5
